{"id":"wb-8-557","name":"中共中央东北局梅河口会议会址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"中共中央东北局梅河口会议会址","text":"中共中央东北局梅河口会议会址，是一座位于中华人民共和国吉林省通化市梅河口市和平街道祥民路1445号的历史建筑。该建筑原为南满洲铁道株式会社的铁路员工宿舍，始建于1936年，现为中国铁路沈阳局集团有限公司梅河口车务段办公楼。中共中央东北局曾于1946年3月至4月期间在此召开梅河口会议。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E4%B8%9C%E5%8C%97%E5%B1%80%E6%A2%85%E6%B2%B3%E5%8F%A3%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE%E4%BC%9A%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92983359,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92983359","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7fd7cd70a4a14d505091fa5f.jpg","title":"Meihekou_Train_Operation_Depot_of_CR_Shenyang_Group_Co.,_Ltd._20260112.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Meihekou_Train_Operation_Depot_of_CR_Shenyang_Group_Co.,_Ltd._20260112.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/Meihekou_Train_Operation_Depot_of_CR_Shenyang_Group_Co.%2C_Ltd._20260112.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"JacobLyu","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​中国铁路沈阳局集团有限公司梅河口车务段办公楼，原中共中央东北局梅河口会议会址","width":320,"height":240}}